<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\洞窟内川.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Going against the cherry tree's voice―that was never even a possible option.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE> lit up the inside with his phone's light, then used matches to light the <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="しょくだい">candle stands</STYLE> set up in the cave.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay, let's go as far in as we can. </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you cover the rear."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Okay, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\歩く響く.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2,000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
The three of us from Motoki-cho, sandwiched between <STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>, made our way through the damp cave.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
What's happening up there right now?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Are the residents attacking the three of them?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or are they still lying in wait, without having <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="たいじ">faced off</STYLE> with them yet?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Either way, it doesn't change the fact that the three left behind are in danger.<PG>
No... back then, my intuition hadn't sensed danger for anyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means they must be all right even as things are.<PG>
............ 
{PAUSE ""}
Huh?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd just had a slightly strange thought.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Ghost.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\倒木幻影.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I had sensed the danger to myself and been able to avoid crashing into the fallen tree.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On the other hand, a lot of the residents had been driven off by <STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, the residents had been in danger of getting taken down by <STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet I hadn't been able to sense the danger falling on the residents.<PG>
Oh, I see, it's because they're all wearing Noh masks and red robes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Dressed like that, you can't tell who anyone is.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So if they're dressed like that...<PG>
Hm?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Huh? Something's weird...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I gained my danger sense after being drenched in <STYLE ID="6">Ojisan</STYLE>'s blood.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I can identify the person, my danger sense works.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And on top of that, in Arata, people dress like that so no one can be identified.<PG>
They say the reason is so the shinigami won't take them away, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is this a coincidence?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or does it mean it would be bad for their danger to be foreseen?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Am I overthinking it?<PG>
But it bothers me, oddly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is a 'shinigami' in the first place?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I know that's what they call people who have died, but where did the idea of them becoming shinigami come from?<PG>
Why do shinigami try to take the living away?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At funerals, they stab with a knife smeared with their own blood, and use the falsificaso...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下3.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
While I was lost in thought, we arrived in front of those iron bars.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> had said was suspicious: the <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="くも">cobwebs</STYLE> on the iron bars―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sure enough, only the door part had no <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="くも">cobwebs</STYLE> on it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\鍵.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Then <STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE> took out a key.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Come on, let's go farther in."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"But cave-ins happen a lot here, right? Is it gonna be okay?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Only around this door. Farther in, the ground's relatively solid, so it's no problem."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I glanced at <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
―She didn't seem to be thinking about anything in particular... 
{PAUSE ""}
Or was she? I couldn't tell.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\鍵さす.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\屋上ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下扉あく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Everyone, farther in."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Urged on by <STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE>, we went through the door.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, lock it up tight. There's no telling when those guys will show up."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\鉄格子開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下5.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> locked it again.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay, now that we've come this far, we're safe. In the back there's a passage that leads out somewhere else. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Pass me the key."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\鍵.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> silently handed <STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE> the door key.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
With <STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE> in the lead, we went on deeper in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But,<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, what's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> had stopped, staring at the rock wall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Where <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> was looking, there was...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\空洞\秘密基地地下根なし.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A bare rock wall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> kept staring at this empty spot.<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Hey, you two, hurry up!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Ah, okay. Come on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"............"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\洞窟内川.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地奥1.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When we went farther in, there was a space just a little bigger than a school classroom.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Several <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="つぼ">pots</STYLE>, large and small, sat on the ground.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But it looked like a dead end there. Was there a hidden passage somewhere?<PG>
Looking closely, I saw pale pink flowers placed in a corner by the wall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\沈丁花.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
New flowers, still fresh and dewy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was that the flower called <STYLE ID="12" RUBY="じんちょうげ">daphne</STYLE>?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地奥1.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, where's the passage? Looks like a dead end..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Haruka</STYLE> looked all around the room.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, of course. This is a dead end."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Hey, what're you talking about..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Then <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> tugged at my sleeve and <STYLE ID="9">Haruka</STYLE>'s.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, what are you planning to do with my </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> to say that... it couldn't be...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎悪.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Kuh-heh-heh-heh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Just what you'd expect of the </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">genius girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I guess?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE>'s voice dropped sharply in tone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地奥2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE> lit all the <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="しょくだい">candle stands</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">... what's that supposed to mean?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\鉈を構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎鉈1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
When <STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE> turned around, he was somehow holding a nata.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"What do I mean... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Necessary, that's what </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE> came toward us, grinning.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, well, for a while there I didn't know how things would turn out... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">When </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> grilled me at breakfast, I'll admit I got nervous. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But somehow I managed to lead you all here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
